Modifications include a Nintendo 3DS platform layer (game/zelda3ds/source), a
live bottom-screen map, stereoscopic rendering, gameplay/quality-of-life
additions, and a C++ port of Loz's asset extractor (ExtractLoz, C#) that runs
on the console and in the PC patcher (patcher/). patcher/data/ holds Loz's
extractor data tables, unchanged. Files under game/Loz/ that were changed
for this port say so in their header ("Modified for The Legend of Zelda:
3DS Edition").

